  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "At police headquarters in Hokkaido, officers haul in more confiscated boxes and gossip about Muranishi's newest release. Then sharp-eyed investigator Takei walks in from Tokyo and reprimands Mori because the books have spread to the capital. Listen to the abrupt shift from casual office chatter to stiff police hierarchy.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "police",
      "t": "また押収したらしいぞ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "police",
      "t": "ほんとですか？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "police",
      "t": "早くしろ！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "police",
      "t": "新作が出たんだって？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "mori",
      "t": "誰だ、お前。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "takei",
      "t": "警視庁の武井だよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "mori",
      "t": "ご苦労さまです。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "takei",
      "t": "また新しい店がオープンしたらしいな。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "takei",
      "t": "北海道だけの問題じゃねえぞ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "takei",
      "t": "東京にも出回ってるんだよ！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "mori",
      "t": "申し訳ございません！",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Notice how fast Mori drops his tough tone the instant Takei names Tokyo headquarters. Let's walk through the key lines.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "police",
      "t": "また押収したらしいぞ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I hear they confiscated another batch.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "police",
      "t": "ほんとですか？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Is that true?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "police",
      "t": "早くしろ！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Hurry up!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "police",
      "t": "新作が出たんだって？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I heard a new release came out?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "mori",
      "t": "誰だ、お前。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Who are you?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "takei",
      "t": "警視庁の武井だよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I am Takei from Tokyo police headquarters.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "mori",
      "t": "ご苦労さまです。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Thank you for your trouble.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "takei",
      "t": "また新しい店がオープンしたらしいな。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I hear another new store opened up.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "takei",
      "t": "北海道だけの問題じゃねえぞ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'This is not just a problem for Hokkaido.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "takei",
      "t": "東京にも出回ってるんだよ！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'They are circulating in Tokyo too!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "mori",
      "t": "申し訳ございません！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'We are deeply sorry!'",
